 "strings": {
  "All right...": "",
  "Fine...!": "",
  "I said all right!": "",
  "Fine!": "",
  "Listen here, asshole.\nI'm gonna sue your ass into the goddamn ground.": "",
  "You sure?\nYou take this, and I really will sue.": "",
  "You see this!?\nHe broke my fucking nose!": "",
  "I'm serious.\nYou broke my fuckin' nose.　": "",
  "Don't be so melodramatic.": "",
  "Looks like a nosebleed to me.": "",
  "I think we both know who\nthrew the first punch.": "",
  "And let's not forget who\nthrew the first punch.　": "",
  "No way I'm gonna let that slide!": "",
  "No way, you hit me first!": "",
  "Just you watch.\nYou'll see, the court's gonna—": "",
  "Just you watch, the courts will—": "",
  "Huh? But that's...": "",
  "Huh? That's...": "",
  "A lawyer's badge.": "",
  "You're a lawyer?　": "",
  "So you're... not a detective.": "",
  "You said you were a detective...": "",
  "And?": "",
  "What of it?　": "",
  "You still wanna sue?": "",
  "Still wanna take this to court?": "",
  "Y'know...": "",
  "Fair warning...": "",
  "You won't know what hit you.": "",
  "Suing me is a bad idea.　": "",
  "Kamurocho.\nNo better place for a night out.": "",
  "There's no better place for a night\non the town than Kamurocho.": "",
  "A neon city... But the brighter the lights,\nthe darker the shadows.": "",
  "Here, bright neon lights make\neven darker shadows...": "",
  "The whole town's run by the toughest\nyakuza family out there, the Tojo Clan.": "",
  "Japan's toughest yakuza, the Tojo Clan,\nkeeps an iron grip on this city.": "",
  "And the deeper you dig,\nthe more interesting things get.": "",
  "Kamurocho gets more interesting\nthe deeper you go...": "",
  "More dangerous, too.": "",
  "...But more dangerous too.　": "",
  "Take this burglary ring.\nJust a bunch of kids looking for kicks.": "",
  "Take this burglary gang.\nJust a bunch of kids doing it for kicks.": "",
  "Word is they met on some sketchy website.\nNever even seen each other's faces.": "",
  "Word is they met on some shady website\nand have never shown each other their faces.": "",
  "As for the cops...\nThey can't catch a single one.": "",
  "And the police can't even manage\nto catch a single one.　": "",
  "The only thing anyone really cares about\nin Kamurocho these days, though...": "",
  "That said, the only thing anyone cares\nabout in Kamurocho these days...": "",
  "...Is the murders.": "",
  "...Is the serial murders.": "",
  "Over three months,\nthree Kansai yakuza have turned up dead.": "",
  "Over the last three months,\nthree Kansai yakuza have turned up dead.　": "",
  "Most think it's the Tojo Clan making some\nkinda power move in the ongoing turf war.": "",
  "Most think it's the Tojo Clan\nputting some muscle on Kansai.": "",
  "This one's missing its eyes too.": "",
  "This one had his eyes gouged out too.": "",
  "That's not the only thing, though.\nAll three of them were missing their eyes.": "",
  "Three yakuza, six eyes,\nall of them gone without a trace.": "",
  "It's in one little corner of\nthis city that I run a detective agency.": "",
  "In one corner of this city,\nI run a detective agency.": "",
  "I work alongside my partner, Kaito-san.\nFunny enough, he's ex-Tojo.": "",
  "An old aniki of mine works for me too.\nKaito-san, who's an ex-Tojo Clan yakuza.": "",
  "And me?": "",
  "As for me...": "",
  "I'm Takayuki Yagami. Used to be a lawyer,\nbut I put that life behind me three years ago.": "",
  "I'm Takayuki Yagami. Three years ago,\nI put the legal life behind me.　": "",
  "As for my badge...": "",
  "Now my lawyer's badge...": "",
  "It's barely even a\ndecoration at this point.": "",
  "...is just for decoration.　": "",
  "Ugh! Damn you!": "",
  "Son of a bitch!": "",
  "Have you had enough?": "",
  "Are we done here?": "",
  "Always getting into trouble...": "",
  "Still finding trouble, Tak?　": "",
  "Captain Hamura...": "",
  "Let go!": "",
  "Lemme go already!": "",
  "You, uh...": "",
  "Um...": "",
  "Our boy Tak here doesn't start\nshit without a real good reason.": "",
  "Tak here doesn't start shit\nwith punks for no reason.": "",
  "And that means...": "",
  "In other words...": "",
  "It was you.\nYou dumbasses jumped the wrong guy.": "",
  "You idiots don't know who\nyou picked a fight with, do you?": "",
  "Huh? No...": "",
  "You know this guy's like a son\nto the Matsugane patriarch, right?": "",
  "You know this guy's like\na son to my patriarch?　": "",
  "Know what I'm trying to say?\nAsshole.": "",
  "Are you getting the picture?": "",
  "C'mon cap, can't we just let it be?": "",
  "C'mon, let's just leave it at that.　": "",
  "No can do.": "",
  "No can do.　": "",
  "This right here...": "",
  "Unfortunately...": "",
  "Just became a matter of\nMatsugane Family honor.": "",
  "...It's a matter of\nMatsugane Family honor.": "",
  "I-I'm sorry...": "",
  "I'm sorry...": "",
  "Hey there, Saori-san.": "",
  "Yo, Saori-san.　": "",
  "Look, dorayaki.\nExtra fancy.": "",
  "I brought dorayaki.\nLimited edition...": "",
  "Genda Law Office,\nwhere I used to work.": "",
  "This is Genda Law Office,\nwhere I used to work.": "",
  "Things haven't changed\nmuch these past three years.": "",
  "I left three years ago,\nso the staff's changed a bit.": "",
  "Hello, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hi, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Oh, I didn't see you there.\nYou getting situated? ": "",
  "Hoshino-kun, hey.\nGetting situated?": "",
  "Yes.\nEveryone here is just great.": "",
  "Yeah, everyone here's great.": "",
  "So I hear you're good.\nPassed the bar with top marks and everything.": "",
  "Heard you're pretty good?\nTop of your class on the bar?": "",
  "How'd you end up in this dump\nand not in a bigger office, huh?": "",
  "So why didn't you join a bigger firm?": "",
  "Huh? Well you see, that's, uh...": "",
  "Oh, well, you know...": "",
  "I hear you over there, Yagami.": "",
  "I can hear you, Yagami.": "",
  "Evening, Genda-sensei.": "",
  "Genda-sensei! Hello!": "",
  "Other than my real dad, there's\ntwo people I look up to like a father.": "",
  "I've got three people I look up to\nlike a father. My actual dad being one.": "",
  "Genda-sensei's one of those people.": "",
  "Genda-sensei is another.": "",
  "He gave me a job here before I'd\neven gotten outta law school.": "",
  "He let me work here\nbefore I even became a lawyer.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei out for the night?": "",
  "Where's Shintani-sensei?": "",
  "I can't keep track of that boy.": "",
  "Haven't seen him in a bit.": "",
  "I'm sure you're happy, though.\nYou don't have to deal with him.": "",
  "Works out for you though, right?\nYou dodged him.": "",
  "You two can't stand each other.": "",
  "Don't you hate each other's guts?": "",
  "You hate each other's guts.\nBe honest with me here.": "",
  "Both of you think the other's an idiot.": "",
  "Hold on now.\nShintani's like a mentor to me.": "",
  "C'mon, I respect the guy like a mentor.": "",
  "So... About that job you have.": "",
  "I don't think he's an idiot.": "",
  "If you really want that job,\nyou're gonna have to get along.": "",
  "You ever want my job,\nyou need to get along with him.": "",
  "So show your senpai\na little more respect.": "",
  "Show some respect to your sensei.": "",
  "Oh, Genda-sensei.": "",
  "Whoa, Genda-sensei.": "",
  "I got you some dorayaki.": "",
  "How does dorayaki sound?": "",
  "Just sit right there.\nI'll grab you one.": "",
  "I think you'll really\nlike 'em, they're...": "",
  "Saori?": "",
  "Really?": "",
  "Did you... eat them all?": "",
  "Are they all... gone?": "",
  "All but half.\nHope you don't mind.": "",
  "There's a... half left.": "",
  "What the–\nWhy is she here?": "",
  "Huh? Why're you here?": "",
  "How 'bout you ask\nher yourself, Romeo.": "",
  "How's about some manners, Tak?": "",
  "Good to see you, Yagami-kun.": "",
  "And how are you, Yagami-kun?": "",
  "Don't worry.\nIt's not what you think.": "",
  "Just so you know...": "",
  "And before you ask,\nshe's not here to win your heart again.": "",
  "...She's not here to win\nyou back or anything.": "",
  "Win my heart again?": "",
  "Win me back?": "",
  "Hold on a minute. Let's make\none thing clear. We never dated.": "",
  "It's not like we ever\nreally started dating...": "",
  "Guess I misspoke.": "",
  "My humble apologies...": "",
  "Don't sue.": "",
  "M'lady Prosecutor. ": "",
  "Mafuyu.": "",
  "Mafuyu!　": "",
  "Not so fast. Who are you?": "",
  "Who the hell are you?": "",
  "Huh? Chief Prosecutor?": "",
  "Hm? Chief Prosecutor?": "",
  "And Yagami-kun?\nWhat are you doing?": "",
  "Yagami-kun? What are you doing?": "",
  "Well I was planning\nto walk you home.": "",
  "I thought I might walk you back...": "",
  "Really?\nThat's so sweet.": "",
  "Oh. Is that all?": "",
  "Well then.\nI apologize for my forcefulness. ": "",
  "I see. So you're Yagami.": "",
  "Sure.": "",
  "Yeah.": "",
  "This is Chief Prosecutor Morita.": "",
  "And, um...": "",
  "Oh and...": "",
  "You already know\nProsecutor Izumida.": "",
  "You already know Prosecutor Izumida.": "",
  "Long time no see, Yagami-sensei.": "",
  "It's been quite a while, Yagami-sensei.": "",
  "Courtroom just hasn't been the same without\nyou around. Damn near breaks my heart. ": "",
  "The courtroom's felt a little emptier\nsince you stopped showing up.　": "",
  "Here, right this way.": "",
  "Right this way.": "",
  "The Matsugane are an\noffshoot of the Tojo Clan.": "",
  "The Tojo Clan's Matsugane Family...": "",
  "Not the biggest yakuza\nfamily on the block.": "",
  "Not exactly the biggest family on the block.": "",
  "They're a small branch\nthat's low on the tree.": "",
  "They're bottom rung.\nA \"branch\" family to those in the know.": "",
  "But the family's patriarch,\nMitsugu Matsugane, is like a father to me.": "",
  "But to me and Kaito-san,\ntheir patriarch, Mitsugu Matsugane...": "",
  "And Kaito-san.": "",
  "...is like a father.": "",
  "Excuse me. \nYagami-san is here to pay you a visit.": "",
  "Boss.\nYagami-san is here to see you.": "",
  "Oh, so good to see\nyou again, my boy.": "",
  "Oh, it's been a while, my boy.": "",
  "Now then, feels like ages\nsince you last stopped by.": "",
  "Why don't you ever stop by anymore?": "",
  "I know.\nI wonder why that is, huh?": "",
  "You wanna know why that is?": "",
  "Could it be that you're the\nonly one who's glad to see me?": "",
  "Because you're the only one\nhere who's glad to see me.": "",
  "Well, you have a point there.": "",
  "Guess you have a point.": "",
  "How's Kaito these days?\nStaying out of trouble?": "",
  "How's Kaito? Still doing well?": "",
  "He's okay. ": "",
  "He's fine.": "",
  "If not for that incident,\nhe'd still be part of the family, you know.": "",
  "If it hadn't been for that mess,\nhe'd still be one of us, you know.": "",
  "Hard to believe it's\nalready been a year.": "",
  "Has a whole year really gone by?": "",
  "Bah, the both of you were more\nor less the sons I never had.": "",
  "The both of you were like\nsons to me, you know.": "",
  "The past is what it is. ": "",
  "What's done is done.": "",
  "True.": "",
  "True...": "",
  "But I'm glad to hear\nhe's doing well... under your watch.": "",
  "But if he's doing well with you...\nI'm happy.": "",
  "I'm sure Kaito-san will\nalways... feel like my aniki.": "",
  "It still feels like Kaito-san is my aniki.": "",
  "If not for you, I would have taken another direction\nin life. I'd be a very different person I think.": "",
  "If I hadn't met you two twenty years ago,\nI'd be a very different person now.": "",
  "You'd have turned out\njust fine, my boy.": ""
 },
